[View Cleaned Dataset – Google Sheets](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1BOck6H1RG6J1hG5ME2i8Qb3zPAouSTzj/edit?usp=sharing)
## Cleaning Activities

- Inspected dataset columns and data types.
- Checked missing values and duplicate records.
- Removed irrelevant and redundant columns.
- Standardized text and geographical values.
- Corrected date and numerical data types.
- Validated the cleaned dataset.
